== Walkthrough ==

Upon creating an Ogre Warrior, you will have a tattered note in your inventory. The note reads as follows:

: You go Guntrik. . .Give note. . .Become Craknek Warrior.

Upon handing the note to [[Guntrik]]:

: [[Guntrik]] says, 'Ahh..  good..  good..  here. take..  now you Craknek! You bash good. Bash lizards. Bash froggies. Bash mushrooms. Remember. you no help Greenbloods. Crakneks stronger than Greenbloods.'

<div class='facblock'>
* Your faction standing with [[Craknek Warriors]] got better.
* Your faction standing with [[Clurg]] got better.
* Your faction standing with [[Green Blood Knights]] got worse.
</div>

{{YouGainExperience}}

You also receive the [[Mud Stained Skin Tunic*]]. Good luck, warrior!

